PRIVACY POLICY
Last updated: June 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Zenith ("we", "us", or "our") 
collects, uses, and protects information when you use our 
Android application ("the App").

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT

1.1 Information You Provide
• License key you enter to activate Premium
• Bug reports you send voluntarily via email

1.2 Information Collected Automatically
• Anonymous usage data (screens visited, features used)
• Device type and Android version
• App crash reports
• General region (country level only, not precise location)

1.3 Information We Do NOT Collect
• Your name or email address
• Your precise GPS location
• Your watch history or search queries
• Payment information of any kind
• Personal identification information

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

2. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION

We use the information collected solely to:
• Verify premium license key validity
• Improve app performance and stability
• Fix bugs and crashes
• Understand which features are used most

We do not use your information for advertising, 
profiling, or any commercial purpose beyond 
operating the App.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

3. DATA STORAGE

3.1 Local Storage
The following data is stored locally on your 
device only and never transmitted to our servers:
• Your downloaded movies
• Your watch history and continue watching progress
• Your app preferences and settings

3.2 Firebase (Google)
We use Google Firebase for:
• License key verification (Firebase Realtime Database)
• Anonymous usage analytics (Firebase Analytics)

Firebase is governed by Google's Privacy Policy:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

Firebase Analytics data is anonymized and 
aggregated. We cannot identify individual users 
from this data.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

4. DATA SHARING

We do not sell, trade, rent, or share your 
personal information with any third party 
except as described below:

• Google Firebase — for license verification 
  and anonymous analytics as described above
• Law enforcement — only if required by law

We do not share your data with advertisers, 
data brokers, or marketing companies.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

5. THIRD PARTY CONTENT

The App displays movie information sourced 
from The Movie Database (TMDB):
https://www.themoviedb.org/privacy-policy

Movie streams are sourced from third party 
embed players. We do not host, store, or 
control any video content. We are not 
responsible for the content, availability, 
or privacy practices of these third party sources.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

6. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY

The App is not directed at children under 
the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect 
personal information from children under 13.

If you believe a child under 13 has provided 
us with personal information, please contact 
us and we will delete it immediately.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

7. DEVICE PERMISSIONS

The App requests the following permissions:

• INTERNET — Required for streaming movies 
  and license verification
• READ/WRITE EXTERNAL STORAGE — Required to 
  save downloaded movies to your device
• FOREGROUND SERVICE — Required to continue 
  downloads when app is in background
• ACCESS NETWORK STATE — Required to check 
  internet connectivity before streaming

We do not request access to your contacts, 
camera, microphone, or precise location.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

8. DATA RETENTION

• License key data is retained in Firebase 
  until you request deletion
• Anonymous analytics data is retained for 
  14 months per Google's standard policy
• Local app data remains on your device until 
  you uninstall the App or clear app data

