10. SECURITY

We take reasonable measures to protect your 
information. License keys are stored in Firebase 
with security rules that prevent unauthorized 
access. Local data on your device is protected 
by Android's built-in security model.

However, no method of transmission over the 
internet is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee 
absolute security of your data.

